{"version":1,"content":"<p>早上7時55分，警方接報指寶珮苑寶瑛閣對開休憩處發生墜物傷人。</p><p>救護員接報到場，發現女事主被從高處墜下的香蕉砸中頭部，她清醒並感頭暈不適，其後由救護車送院治理。</p><p>警方事後封鎖休憩處調查，事件交由刑事調查隊跟進。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:07.007851+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T03:08:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.533788+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.794893+00:00","content_hash":"e7bb6502f336e24cab2597b2b09f6e47579cf2bf6062c38661d9505e3143576f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}